---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — Biotite Solutions"
  description="How Biotite Solutions handles information collected through this website."
>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Privacy</p>
        <h1 class="t-display t-2xl" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.06s">Privacy policy</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p>
          This website is a static site. It does not set cookies, run
          advertising trackers, or require an account.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-lg">What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          Browsing this site does not send personal information to Biotite
          Solutions. If analytics are added in the future, this policy will be
          updated to describe exactly what is measured.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-lg">Scheduling and outreach</h2>
        <p>
          If you book a call, scheduling is handled by Calendly under its own
          privacy policy; the details you enter there (name, email, notes) are
          used solely to prepare for and conduct the conversation. If you
          contact us on LinkedIn or YouTube, those platforms' policies apply.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-lg">Client information</h2>
        <p>
          Information shared with us during an engagement is treated as
          confidential by default. We do not publish client names, data,
          screenshots, or results without written approval — which is why the
          case studies on this site are anonymized.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-lg">Questions</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy question, raise it in an
          <a href="/contact/" class="link-inline">introductory call</a> or
          via LinkedIn and we will respond directly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
